# The TileFoundry ref this site documents. A reader following these pages runs a
# released TileFoundry, so the site renders the release rather than main -- docs
# describing a command that is not in the reader's install is worse than docs
# that lag. Bump this when a release goes out; the published pages carry the ref
# in their footer, so what a page documents is never a guess.
#
# The first line that is neither blank nor a comment is the ref. A one-off render
# of something else -- main, a branch, a SHA -- goes through the publish
# workflow's source_ref input and does not touch this file.
v0.0.3
